{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CosmoKnowledgeMap 是一款個人知識地圖工具，能把從 Safari 收集得來的網頁與筆記化成星點與連結，並以 3D 星圖呈現頁面、主題之間的關係。適合研究人員、學生及需要整理大量資料的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-175.webp\">\n<h2>四種視角探索知識星圖</h2>\n<p>以全文搜尋為起點，從結果跳進星點，再沿連結發掘意外關聯。內置球體、星雲、類神經網絡與平面四種檢視方式，從不同角度探索同一批資料。可挑選主題產生文字交給 AI 擴充地圖，毋須 API 金鑰或額外付費。每個筆記本可設獨立數字密碼。內附日本星圖範例，另有宇宙崩塌模式，關閉後即返回原圖，資料只儲存於裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-53-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-54-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-201-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-202-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-203-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-204-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CosmoKnowledgeMap</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T15:19:53.458695+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T15:12:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T19:17:44.577772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:17:42.604923+00:00","content_hash":"6e0bd9c071c81b0567fe9e002a5b30b2f59f483fdb3b7adf9f3d9787360f8cf2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}